+// Rollback/measurement hook: the main thread (id 1) was woken from a wait and no guest code is on the host
+// stack (the dispatcher is between two guest calls, no thread running). Everything the EE sees is plain data
+// at this point, so the hook may hash, save or restore the whole machine (EeScheduler::saveState/loadState).
